STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We may invest in mezzanine loans that are senior to the borrower&#146;s common and preferred equity in, and subordinate to a first mortgage
