exposure to the asset, potentially resulting in the loss of some or all of our investment. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>Construction Loans </I></FONT></P> <P
