SIZE="2"><B><I>Valuation and Allocation of Real Property Acquisitions </I></B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Upon acquisition, the purchase price of a real
