STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">If we qualify for taxation as a REIT, we generally will not be subject to federal corporate income taxes on that portion of our ordinary
