the Exchange Act. In addition, we have over 100 independent stockholders, such that shares of common stock are &#147;widely held.&#148; Whether a security is &#147;freely transferable&#148; depends upon the particular facts and circumstances. Shares
of common stock are subject to certain restrictions on transferability intended to ensure that we continue to qualify for federal income tax treatment as a REIT. The regulation provides, however, that where the minimum
